# Build-context hygiene for the Coolify Docker build (context = backend/).
# The Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, so anything NOT excluded here is baked into the
# image. Keep secrets, local envs, caches, the virtualenv, VCS, and dev-only
# files out of the runtime image. (alembic/, alembic.ini, requirements.txt,
# docker-entrypoint.sh and all app code are intentionally NOT excluded — the
# entrypoint runs `alembic upgrade head` on start.)

# Secrets & environment — must never be baked into the image.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example

# Keys / certificates
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Python bytecode, test/tool caches, and the local virtualenv
# (large, and contains wrong-platform binaries).
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
pytest-cache-files-*/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Tests & documentation — not needed in the runtime image.
tests/
*.md

# VCS, local tooling, and Docker/build meta — not part of the runtime image.
.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
docker-compose*.yaml
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
node_modules/

# Dev-only setup scripts.
setup.sh
setup.ps1
